WEBVTT

NOTE
The Sorceress Memorial — Squall reaches Rinoa as she faces being sealed.
Duration: approximately 27 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.780
In the Sorceress Memorial's sealing chamber, the spiked mechanism closes in.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.350
Squall cries out and reaches for Rinoa across the room.

00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:22.810
The two come together in a tight embrace.
